---
title: Russian Lamb Pilaf (Plov) Recipe
description: This Russian recipe for lamb rice pilaf features plumped dried prunes and raisins and a healthy pinch of saffron to give it a sunny yellow color.
image: https://www.thespruceeats.com/thmb/R43z3XeYn_XSTn26ES5fieJc_jU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/GettyImages-1254456365-cf480b0d59484d6c9c4f44a5d3d6310f.jpg
